<section class="top-page-hero-section">
    <section class="product-hero is-top">
        <div class="container is-fluid">
            <div class="columns">
                <div class="column is-5">
<figure class="image">
    <picture>
        <source srcset="/media/jufdnhkh/treif-oberlahr-location.jpg?width=546&amp;height=582&amp;format=webp&amp;v=1dc1767e20f5c00" type="image/webp" />
        <source srcset="/media/jufdnhkh/treif-oberlahr-location.jpg?width=546&amp;height=582&amp;v=1dc1767e20f5c00" />
        <img src="/media/jufdnhkh/treif-oberlahr-location.jpg?width=546&amp;height=582&amp;v=1dc1767e20f5c00" height="582" width="546" style="aspect-ratio: 546 / 582; object-fit: cover;" alt="Treif Oberlahr Location" loading="lazy">
    </picture>
</figure>                </div>
                <div class="column top-page-hero-text-column is-6 is-offset-1">
                    <h2 class="title top-page-hero-title">TREIF is part of JBT Marel</h2>
                        <h2 class="title top-page-hero-subtitle">Technological leaders with a shared passion for innovation</h2>
                        <div class="top-page-hero-content">
                          <div class="content">
                            <p>At TREIF, we proudly stand as technological leaders renowned for our expertise in slicing, dicing, portion cutting, and bread cutting solutions. The global recognition of the TREIF brand is a testament to our passion and commitment to food cutting. Central to our success lies an unwavering focus on innovation and cutting-edge technology, backed by an experienced team and enduring partnerships with our customers.</p>
<p>JBT Marel’s acquisition of TREIF in 2020 marked the union of two technological leaders who share a common passion for innovation and a collective vision to transform the way food is processed. The TREIF product portfolio spanning machines, production lines and systems is highly complementary with JBT Marel’s extensive offering. Together, we drive growth and enhance value for our existing customers while laying the foundation for superior offerings for all future customers.</p>
                           </div>
                        </div>
               
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</section>
